{"id":"8d01f06a62827a91","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity.md","title":"结构化层次的单调性","display":"thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity — 结构化层次的单调性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity","aliases":["72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity"],"display":"thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity — 结构化层次的单调性","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","[[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]","[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Thm.2.21(1–3); print159–160; PDF171–172","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-structured-hierarchy-monotonicity — 结构化层次的单调性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" href=\"?note=c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" title=\"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism\">72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Thm.2.21(1–3); print159–160; PDF171–172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 及递增穷尽见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|\\)</span> 与有限树序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline k\">\\(\\overline k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" href=\"?note=c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" title=\"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism\">72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,B,F\">\\(H,B,F\\)</span> 及有限迭代见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fcd2431dc7fa995d\" href=\"?note=fcd2431dc7fa995d\" title=\"72-df-hardy-hierarchy\">72-df-hardy-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8e620b5020310301\" href=\"?note=8e620b5020310301\" title=\"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy\">72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\le n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\alpha(m)\\le G_\\alpha(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\le n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\alpha(m)\\le G_\\alpha(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\alpha\\notin\\{\\overline k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\land m&lt;n\\right)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\alpha(m)&lt;G_\\alpha(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\alpha\\notin\\{\\overline k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\land m&lt;n\\right)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ G_\\alpha(m)&lt;G_\\alpha(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&lt;n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\left(H_\\alpha(m)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\alpha(m)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land F_\\alpha(m)&lt;F_\\alpha(n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&lt;n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\left(H_\\alpha(m)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\alpha(m)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\land F_\\alpha(m)&lt;F_\\alpha(n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ \\left(G_\\beta(n)&lt;G_\\alpha(n)\\land H_\\beta(n)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\beta(n)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ \\left(G_\\beta(n)&lt;G_\\alpha(n)\\land H_\\beta(n)&lt;H_\\alpha(n)\\land B_\\beta(n)&lt;B_\\alpha(n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ F_\\beta(n)&lt;F_\\alpha(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n&gt;0\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\ F_\\beta(n)&lt;F_\\alpha(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_\\alpha(0)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_\\alpha(0)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.21 及其证明，印刷 pp.159–160 / PDF pp.171–172。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的前驱比较须保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>；所有层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\alpha(0)\">\\(F_\\alpha(0)\\)</span> 都等于一，不能在零输入声称层间严格不等式。原书经 Hardy 恒等式导出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,F\">\\(B,F\\)</span> 的比较；这里给出不额外依赖结构化算术闭包的直接归纳。</p>\n<p>由有限链引理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[n]\\subsetneq\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\beta[n]\\subsetneq\\alpha[n]\\)</span>；配合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的基数等式得到层间严格性。递增穷尽给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的非减性。对极限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\">\\(\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\\)</span>，结构化条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha_{n+1}[n+1]\">\\(\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha_{n+1}[n+1]\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{\\alpha_n}(n)\\le G_{\\alpha_n}(n+1)&lt;G_{\\alpha_{n+1}}(n+1)\">\\(G_{\\alpha_n}(n)\\le G_{\\alpha_n}(n+1)&lt;G_{\\alpha_{n+1}}(n+1)\\)</span>。后继保持严格性，故非有限树的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 严格递增。</p>\n<p>先对所有树归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\gamma(x)\\ge x\">\\(H_\\gamma(x)\\ge x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\gamma(x)&gt;x\">\\(B_\\gamma(x)&gt;x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\gamma(x)&gt;x\">\\(F_\\gamma(x)&gt;x\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\gamma(0)=1\">\\(F_\\gamma(0)=1\\)</span>。再同时对结构化树归纳，证明输入严格递增和前驱比较。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的零分支为恒等函数；后继输入严格性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\gamma(n+1)&lt;H_\\gamma(n+2)\">\\(H_\\gamma(n+1)&lt;H_\\gamma(n+2)\\)</span>。后继前驱分成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\gamma\">\\(\\beta=\\gamma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\gamma[n]\">\\(\\beta\\in\\gamma[n]\\)</span>，分别用输入严格性，或先用归纳的前驱比较再用输入严格性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的后继为两次复合，严格递增性保持，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\gamma(B_\\gamma(n))&gt;B_\\gamma(n)\">\\(B_\\gamma(B_\\gamma(n))&gt;B_\\gamma(n)\\)</span>；同样处理后继前驱。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的后继在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 次。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\gamma\">\\(F_\\gamma\\)</span> 严格递增且处处大于输入，把输入从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 改成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 并增加一次迭代会严格增大值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 时迭代至少两次，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathsf S\\gamma}(n)&gt;F_\\gamma(n)\">\\(F_{\\mathsf S\\gamma}(n)&gt;F_\\gamma(n)\\)</span>，继而给出后继前驱比较。</p>\n<p>三个层次在极限处的输入比较完全同形：先由对子树的归纳假设把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 增到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha_{n+1}[n+1]\">\\(\\alpha_n\\in\\alpha_{n+1}[n+1]\\)</span> 的前驱比较，把子树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\">\\(\\alpha_n\\)</span> 升到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{n+1}\">\\(\\alpha_{n+1}\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 此时比较输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 必为正。极限处的层间比较直接归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_n\">\\(\\alpha_n\\)</span>。这些推导只使用结构化条件及既有递归式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8e620b5020310301","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及递增穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$ 与有限树序数 $\\overline k$ 见 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]；$H,B,F$ 及有限迭代见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc